From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 20:03:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dpu: load polyphase filter LUTs into the QSEED scaler

The scaler's built-in filter is bilinear, which softens upscales and
aliases downscales past about 1.5x. Load a separable LUT picked by the
scale ratio instead. Upscaling uses Catmull Rom. Downscaling by 1.25x
to 4x, the qseed3lite limit, uses area filters that weight each source
pixel by its overlap with the output pixel.


diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_plane.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_plane.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_plane.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_plane.c
@@ -468,6 +468,101 @@ module_param_array(dpu_de_adjust_b, int, NULL, 0644);
 static int dpu_de_adjust_c[DPU_MAX_DE_CURVES] = { 0, 0, -2 };
 module_param_array(dpu_de_adjust_c, int, NULL, 0644);
 
